# Managed by mksrv. Ensures /var/lib/mksrv/metrics exists on every host before
# node-exporter's textfile-collector bind mount is (re)started — writing any
# templated file creates its parent directories (WriteFileSudo mkdir -p), so
# this placeholder is the guarantee, not the content. Freestanding .prom
# metric files (e.g. the backup job's last-success timestamp) are dropped in
